# ── Fighter images ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The painted/realistic portrait pack is ~2.8 GB and is produced by the
# separate E:/FighterArt pipeline (sync/syncassets.py copies approvals in).
# The manifest and tags stay tracked so the pack's shape is versioned; the
# app falls back to the tracked Placeholders (and flat-vector art) when the
# PNGs are absent, so a fresh clone still builds and runs.
Wpf/Assets/Painted/**/*.png
Wpf/Assets/Painted/**/*.jpg
Wpf/Assets/Faces/

# ── Old asset snapshots, scratch output, review screenshots ────────────
_archive/
output/
review-output/
.eldmoor-review-cache/

# Throwaway previews at the repo root (kept assets live in Wpf/Assets/)
/*.png

# ── Tools: generated renders, logs, Python caches ──────────────────────
tools/orgbrand/**/*.png
tools/**/raw/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
